        "title": "Eliminate a base",
        "text": "We can eliminate any choices involving log base $$4$$, because $$4$$ cannot be the base of any equation, since the number $$4$$ raised to an integer power will never be odd. And both $$3$$ and $$81$$ are odd numbers.",
